        "TileImage": "$($repository f09f6820-86a7-400b-9c6a-c8798ae410e2).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, Agent. A despicable new Cyber-Mafia has risen to prominence, operating on the dark web. Within the underground night club in Berlin, lies the first few members we managed to identify. The masked members are each carrying a data disk (pretend to pick up) that you will need to retrieve. Our client wants us to dismante the syndicate piece by piece. Retrieve the disks so we can learn their next targets. \r\rBon Voyage, Agent. \r\r- Diana.",
